---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="About the Author — Cool, Calm & Karter"
  description="Meet Ki-Jana Thomas, father, author, and the heart behind the Cool, Calm & Karter 'And Baby' series."
>
  <article class="about">
    <h1>About the Author</h1>

    <p>
      <strong>
        Meet Ki-Jana Thomas — Father, Author, and the Heart Behind the &ldquo;And
        Baby&rdquo; Series
      </strong>
    </p>

    <p>
      Ki-Jana Thomas discovered his passion for writing children’s books after
      the birth of his son, Karter. Becoming a father opened his eyes to the
      magic of everyday moments — the laughter, the challenges, the milestones
      — and inspired him to capture those memories through storytelling.
      That’s how the “And Baby” series was born.
    </p>

    <p>
      Through books like <em>Black, Beautiful & Baby</em> and
      <em>Black, Puerto Rican & Baby</em>, Ki-Jana creates heartwarming
      stories that celebrate identity, culture, and confidence. His mission
      is to fill the shelves with stories that reflect the beauty of every
      child — especially those who have been underrepresented for too long.
    </p>

    <p>
      But these books aren’t just for families of color — they’re for
      everyone. Ki-Jana believes that through stories, we can all learn to
      love ourselves and better understand each other. His writing is a
      bridge — teaching children to embrace who they are while inspiring
      families to celebrate the uniqueness in others.
    </p>

    <p>
      Whether it’s a bedtime laugh in <em>Go To Sleep, Karter</em> or a lesson
      in self-love and joy, every Cool, Calm & Karter book is crafted with
      care, connection, and a big dose of heart.
    </p>

    <p>
      And the impact doesn’t stop on the page. For every book sold, we donate
      a copy to a child in foster care, a child in need, or an underserved
      community — because we believe every child deserves to feel seen,
      celebrated, and loved.
    </p>

    <p>
      <strong>
        Thank you for supporting Ki-Jana and the team at Cool, Calm & Karter.
        With your help, we’re building a brighter, more inclusive future —
        one book at a time.
      </strong>
    </p>

    <a class="browse-button" href="/shop">Browse Books</a>
  </article>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .about {
    max-width: 720px;
    margin: 0 auto;
